      "message": "If you look at the build logs, you\u0027ll see errors on this line (and others). I recently added `-fno-lax-vector-conversions` to the clang command line arguments. Clang will still allow `F` to be silently converted to `__mm512`, but it will not allow any integer vectors to be converted to `__mm512i`. You can see how I had to fix this down in the HSW section. The fix is pretty easy, it just requires explicit casts to `__m512i` when passing any integer vector to an intrinsic, and then casting any integer vector back to the proper return type.",
